              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{% set salt_entity = 'sensor.aquapure_probe_talokan_salt_level' %}\n{% set confirmed = as_datetime(state_attr(salt_entity, 'last_successful_reading'), none) %}\n{% if state_attr(salt_entity, 'stale') or states(salt_entity) in ['unknown', 'unavailable'] %}\n**⚠ Salt: last known reading — update unavailable.**\n{% else %}\n**Salt reading confirmed.**\n{% endif %}\n{% if confirmed %}Last confirmed **{{ relative_time(confirmed) }} ago** · {{ as_local(confirmed).strftime('%b %-d, %-I:%M %p') }}.{% endif %}\n\nSalt goal: **about 3,200 ppm** · Range **3,000–3,500 ppm**.\n\n{% set sample = as_datetime(states('sensor.atlantis_last_measurement'), none) %}Chemistry sample: **{{ relative_time(sample) ~ ' ago' if sample else 'time unavailable' }}**. Salt and water temperature refresh separately.",
